+| preset | seed | model | result |
+|---|---:|---|---|
+| easy | 909246400 | Claude Sonnet 5 | HTTP 403 key limit |
+| easy | 2004244930 | Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview | HTTP 403 key limit |
