+        "alignment is polynomial time (randomized polynomial in d and log(p), "
+        "with O(d^3) elementary alignment); at the intended hard preset the "
+        "standard-library specialization measured 1,427,306 field operations "
+        "and 0.050619 s, whereas the centered-moment route uses at most 280 "
