+# Parked: external oracle quota
+
+The module is complete through local gates G1–G8. On 2026-09-05 each of the required bare, structural-hint, and placebo `scripts/harden.py` runs made four redraws, and every OpenRouter request returned HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded (total limit)`. Each harness invocation exited with “oracle pool is unreachable — cannot make a hardness claim.”
+
+This is neither a failure of G, H, or V nor a `REJECTED.md` result. It is external missing evidence. The harness-owned partial bare transcript and metadata are retained verbatim; the two scratch transcripts were copied back under their required G9 names. Restore OpenRouter quota and rerun all three loops before changing G9 or `all_passed` to true.
