Implemented and locally verified a native Track B polynomial-isomorphism generator based on the paper’s Section 8 problem definition. The paper itself notes PI is believed efficiently solvable in most cases, so Track A would be unjustified. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2511.06843v2)

